+
+## Codegen Summary: microsoft/resnet-50
+
+### Files in `microsoft/resnet-50/model/graph_0/`
+
+| File | Lines | Purpose |
+|------|-------|---------|
+| `main.py` | 5733 | Forward pass, weight loading, activation loading, entry point |
+| `consteval.py` | 8209 | Compile-time constant evaluation (BatchNorm folding into conv weights) |
+| `utils.py` | 83 | Device singleton, tensor loading helper, global semaphore helper |
+| `ttir_cpu.py` | 908 | Pure-torch CPU implementations of TTIR ops (used by consteval) |
+| `__init__.py` | 3 | License header only |
+| `../../xla.py` | 146 | XLA reference: loads HuggingFace ResNet-50, runs codegen/inference/golden comparison |
+
+### Structure of `main.py`
+
+**4 functions, one massive:**
+
+1. **`_main(activations, weights)`** (lines 8–3038, ~3030 lines): The forward pass — a single flat function with sequentially numbered ttnn ops. This is the core refactoring target.
+2. **`load_activations_for__main()`** (lines 3041–3052): Loads 1 activation tensor from `./tensors/arg27.tensorbin`.
+3. **`load_weights_for__main()`** (lines 3058–5722): Loads 266 weight tensors from `.tensorbin` files into a global `_main_weights` dict keyed by HuggingFace parameter names (e.g., `"resnet.encoder.stages.0.layers.0.layer.0.convolution.weight"`).
+4. **`main()`** (lines 5725–5729): Entry point — calls load_activations, load_weights, then `_main()`.
+
+### Forward Pass (`_main`) Op Inventory
+
+| Op | Count |
+|----|-------|
+| `ttnn.conv2d` | 53 |
+| `ttnn.add` (residual) | 16 |
+| `ttnn.relu` | 16 |
+| `ttnn.deallocate` | 64 |
+| `ttnn.to_memory_config` | 12 |
+| `ttnn.max_pool2d` | 1 |
+| `ttnn.mean` (global avg pool) | 1 |
+| `ttnn.linear` (classifier) | 1 |
